 "_doc": "N165 (owner, 27 Nov: «funzionalità e non plugin»): what the admin opens or closes to users and groups. A feature names its pages (the menu hides them), its plugins (the chat's agent offers them only to who may), its API prefixes (refused to who may not: only prefixes no other page uses, test_access_features checks it against every page's calls). default: all = everyone, as before; admin = the admin's until opened. A plugin in no feature stays a feature of its own, plugin:<name> (connectors and tools). The machine's pages (api/modules' adminOnly) are never here: the admin's alone.",
