 "_doc_user_plugins": "N167 (owner, 27 Nov: «i plugin… diventassero a livello utente… solo quelli come ntfy, link checker e cose che hanno un senso di essere amministrative… solo per l'admin»): a plugin in no feature is open to everyone by default when it is listed here — each one's account settings are of scope user, so nobody acts with another's account; every other one (ntfy, linkcheck, self, cloud, senses, security, the backup, the machine's Home Assistant tools, a new or forged plugin) is the admin's until the admin opens it. It replaces plg_access's FOR_USERS (4 Oct)."
